    "citation": "Suvarnaprabhasasutra (= Suvarnabhasottamasutra) | Based on the ed. by S. Bagchi: Suvarnaprabhasasutram, | Darbhanga: The Mithila Institute, 1967. | (Buddhist Sanskrit Texts, 8) | Input by members of the Sanskrit Buddhist Canon Input Project.",
