    "citation": "Pratisarakalpadharani | Bsed on the edition \"Pratisarākalpadhāraṇī\". Dhīḥ Journal 28 (1999), eds. S. Rinpoche and Janardan Pandey, pp. 140-142. | Input by Klaus Wille (Göttingen) | NOTE: | This text is included in the ed. of Iwamoto, Yutaka: Mahāpratisarā Pañcarakṣā II,",
